// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (git-ignored; never commit real credentials).
//
// MyAIWorker needs an Anthropic API key to stream agent responses.
// The $(NAME) form resolves from the environment when building via
// xcodebuild or Xcode launched from that shell; paste a literal value
// instead for Dock-launched Xcode:
//   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY = sk-ant-...
//
// The key flows Secrets.xcconfig -> Support/Info.plist (AnthropicAPIKey)
// -> Bundle at launch. The app shows a setup screen when it's missing —
// no key ever appears in source or git history.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY = $(ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)
